  "description": "# SIP2.11: Add 3 Arks to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDCe Fleet on sonic\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 3 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDCe Fleet on sonic.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on sonic.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: sonic\n- Fleet Commander: 0x507A2D9E87DBD3076e65992049C41270b47964f8\n- Number of Arks to add: 3\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0xF67e17c4627E9D9C150b247b6A4e82c01Bf36c5F`\n2. `0x4c62Fc0393393F3A5e455576BdA95Ccb3E284b19`\n3. `0x39C5d327FF8b12649A0A8056cA4499Cb27f82fa0`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on sonic:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-11-adding-new-silo-vaults-to-usdc-e-sonic-vault/233\n",
